---
<!doctype html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>뤼미에르 스파 — 청담 다크 럭셔리 뷰티·네일·왁싱·스파</title>
  <meta name="description" content="청담동 프리미엄 다크 럭셔리 뷰티 스파. 페이셜, 네일, 왁싱, 바디 트리트먼트. 블랙 골드 무드의 고요한 휴식을 예약하세요." />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Playfair+Display:ital,wght@0,500;0,600;0,700;0,800;1,500&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
  <style>
    :root{
      /* Brand — jasonmoon.dev dark + gold */
      --bg:#070b14;
      --surface:#0d1422;
      --surface-2:#131a26;
      --amber:#ffb000;
      --gold:#d4af37;
      --fg:#e8ecf2;
      --muted:#8ea0b8;
      --faint:#4a5a74;
      --border:#1e2d45;
      --border-2:#2c3f5c;

      --grad-gold:linear-gradient(135deg,#ffb000 0%,#d4af37 100%);
      --grad-gold-soft:linear-gradient(135deg,rgba(255,176,0,0.16) 0%,rgba(212,175,55,0.08) 100%);

      --r-md:16px;
      --r-lg:20px;
      --r-xl:28px;

      --shadow-soft:0 12px 40px -12px rgba(0,0,0,0.55);
      --shadow-lift:0 28px 60px -18px rgba(0,0,0,0.7), 0 0 0 1px rgba(255,176,0,0.08);
      --shadow-gold:0 16px 40px -14px rgba(255,176,0,0.4);

      --dur:220ms;
      --ease:cubic-bezier(0.16,1,0.3,1);
    }

    *{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0;}

    html{scroll-behavior:smooth;}

    body{
      font-family:'Inter','Pretendard',system-ui,sans-serif;
      background:var(--bg);
      color:var(--fg);
      font-size:16px;
      line-height:1.7;
      -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
      overflow-x:hidden;
    }

    /* atmospheric gold glow */
    body::before{
      content:"";
      position:fixed;
      inset:0;
      z-index:0;
      pointer-events:none;
      background:
        radial-gradient(900px 600px at 78% -8%, rgba(255,176,0,0.10), transparent 60%),
        radial-gradient(700px 500px at -6% 100%, rgba(212,175,55,0.06), transparent 60%);
    }

    h1,h2,h3{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;line-height:1.12;letter-spacing:-0.01em;}

    a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none;}

    .wrap{max-width:1200px;margin:0 auto;padding:0 28px;position:relative;z-index:1;}

    .text-gold{
      background:var(--grad-gold);
      -webkit-background-clip:text;
      background-clip:text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color:transparent;
      color:transparent;
    }

    /* ---- Buttons ---- */
    .btn{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;
      font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-weight:600;font-size:15px;
      padding:15px 28px;border-radius:999px;cursor:pointer;
      transition:transform var(--dur) var(--ease), box-shadow var(--dur) var(--ease), background var(--dur) var(--ease);
      border:1px solid transparent;white-space:nowrap;
    }
    .btn:focus-visible{outline:none;box-shadow:0 0 0 3px var(--bg),0 0 0 6px var(--amber);}
    .btn-primary{background:var(--grad-gold);color:#1a1206;box-shadow:var(--shadow-gold);}
    .btn-primary:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);box-shadow:0 22px 50px -14px rgba(255,176,0,0.55);}
    .btn-outline{background:transparent;color:var(--fg);border:1px solid var(--border-2);}
    .btn-outline:hover{transform:translateY(-3px);border-color:var(--amber);color:var(--amber);background:rgba(255,176,0,0.05);}

    .icon{width:20px;height:20px;flex:none;stroke:currentColor;fill:none;stroke-width:1.7;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;}

    /* ---- Nav ---- */
    .nav{
      position:sticky;top:40px;z-index:50;
      backdrop-filter:blur(12px);
      background:rgba(7,11,20,0.72);
      border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .nav-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;height:72px;}
    .brand{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:23px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:0.01em;}
    .brand small{display:block;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.32em;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;margin-top:2px;}
    .nav-links{display:flex;gap:34px;align-items:center;}
    .nav-links a{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);transition:color var(--dur) var(--ease);position:relative;}
    .nav-links a:hover{color:var(--fg);}
    .nav-links a::after{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;bottom:-6px;width:0;height:2px;background:var(--grad-gold);transition:width var(--dur) var(--ease);border-radius:2px;}
    .nav-links a:hover::after{width:100%;}
    .nav-cta{font-size:14px;}
    @media(max-width:860px){.nav-links{display:none;}}

    /* ---- Hero ---- */
    .hero{padding:84px 0 96px;position:relative;}
    .hero-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.05fr 0.95fr;gap:64px;align-items:center;}
    .badge{
      display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;
      font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:0.02em;
      padding:8px 16px;border-radius:999px;
      background:rgba(255,176,0,0.08);border:1px solid rgba(255,176,0,0.28);color:var(--amber);
      margin-bottom:26px;
    }
    .dot{width:8px;height:8px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--amber);box-shadow:0 0 0 4px rgba(255,176,0,0.18);animation:pulse 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;}
    @keyframes pulse{0%,100%{opacity:1;}50%{opacity:0.45;}}
    .hero h1{font-size:clamp(3rem,2rem+4.4vw,5.4rem);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:22px;}
    .hero h1 em{font-style:italic;font-weight:500;}
    .hero-lead{font-size:19px;color:var(--muted);max-width:30rem;margin-bottom:36px;line-height:1.65;}
    .hero-cta{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:42px;}

    .proof{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:26px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
    .proof-stars{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;}
    .stars{display:flex;gap:2px;}
    .stars svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:var(--amber);}
    .proof-num{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;}
    .proof-label{font-size:13px;color:var(--faint);}
    .proof-div{width:1px;height:34px;background:var(--border-2);}

    /* hero visual */
    .hero-visual{position:relative;height:520px;}
    .hv-card{
      position:absolute;border-radius:var(--r-xl);overflow:hidden;
      box-shadow:var(--shadow-soft);border:1px solid var(--border);
    }
    .hv-main{
      inset:0;
      background:
        radial-gradient(120% 90% at 70% 15%, rgba(255,176,0,0.22), transparent 55%),
        linear-gradient(160deg,#131a26 0%,#0a0f1a 100%);
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:flex-end;padding:34px;
    }
    .hv-main::before{
      content:"";position:absolute;top:-40%;right:-30%;width:80%;height:80%;
      border-radius:50%;
      background:radial-gradient(circle, rgba(212,175,55,0.35), transparent 70%);
      filter:blur(18px);
    }
    .hv-ring{
      position:absolute;top:40px;left:40px;width:108px;height:108px;border-radius:50%;
      border:1.5px solid rgba(255,176,0,0.4);
      display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
    }
    .hv-ring span{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:32px;}
    .hv-tag{position:relative;z-index:1;}
    .hv-tag .t1{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.3em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;}
    .hv-tag .t2{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:30px;margin-top:8px;}
    .hv-float{
      bottom:-26px;left:-26px;width:206px;padding:20px 22px;
      background:rgba(13,20,34,0.92);backdrop-filter:blur(10px);
      display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;
    }
    .hv-float .ic{width:46px;height:46px;border-radius:14px;background:var(--grad-gold-soft);border:1px solid rgba(255,176,0,0.25);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--amber);flex:none;}
    .hv-float .hv-num{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:24px;font-weight:700;line-height:1;}
    .hv-float .hv-cap{font-size:12px;color:var(--muted);margin-top:3px;}

    /* ---- Sections ---- */
    section{padding:96px 0;position:relative;}
    .sec-head{max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 60px;text-align:center;}
    .eyebrow{font-size:12.5px;letter-spacing:0.34em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:16px;display:block;}
    .sec-head h2{font-size:clamp(2.1rem,1.5rem+2vw,3.2rem);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:18px;}
    .sec-head p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);}

    /* services */
    .services{background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(13,20,34,0.5),transparent);}
    .svc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px;}
    .svc-card{
      background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r-xl);
      padding:30px 26px;transition:transform var(--dur) var(--ease),box-shadow var(--dur) var(--ease),border-color var(--dur) var(--ease);
      display:flex;flex-direction:column;
    }
    .svc-card:hover{transform:translateY(-8px);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lift);border-color:var(--border-2);}
    .svc-ic{width:58px;height:58px;border-radius:18px;background:var(--grad-gold-soft);border:1px solid rgba(255,176,0,0.22);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--amber);margin-bottom:24px;}
    .svc-ic svg{width:28px;height:28px;}
    .svc-card h3{font-size:21px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:10px;}
    .svc-card p{font-size:14.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.6;flex:1;margin-bottom:22px;}
    .svc-foot{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding-top:18px;}
    .svc-price{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:700;}
    .svc-price small{font-size:13px;color:var(--faint);font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-weight:400;}
    .svc-arrow{color:var(--gold);transition:transform var(--dur) var(--ease);}
    .svc-card:hover .svc-arrow{transform:translateX(5px);}

    /* values */
    .val-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:28px;}
    .val-card{padding:34px 30px;border-radius:var(--r-lg);background:var(--surface-2);border:1px solid var(--border);transition:transform var(--dur) var(--ease),border-color var(--dur) var(--ease);}
    .val-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);border-color:var(--border-2);}
    .val-ic{width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;border:1.5px solid rgba(255,176,0,0.35);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--amber);margin-bottom:22px;}
    .val-ic svg{width:26px;height:26px;}
    .val-card h3{font-size:20px;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:12px;}
    .val-card p{font-size:15px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.65;}

    /* gallery */
    .gal-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);grid-auto-rows:200px;gap:18px;}
    .gal{border-radius:var(--r-lg);overflow:hidden;border:1px solid var(--border);position:relative;transition:transform var(--dur) var(--ease),box-shadow var(--dur) var(--ease);cursor:pointer;}
    .gal:hover{transform:scale(1.018);box-shadow:var(--shadow-lift);}
    .gal.tall{grid-row:span 2;}
    .gal .cap{position:absolute;left:20px;bottom:18px;z-index:2;}
    .gal .cap .c1{font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.26em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--gold);font-weight:600;}
    .gal .cap .c2{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:21px;margin-top:4px;}
    .gal::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent 40%,rgba(7,11,20,0.78));z-index:1;}
    .g1{background:radial-gradient(120% 100% at 30% 20%,rgba(255,176,0,0.3),transparent 60%),linear-gradient(150deg,#1a2436,#0a0f1a);}
    .g2{background:radial-gradient(120% 100% at 70% 30%,rgba(212,175,55,0.28),transparent 60%),linear-gradient(150deg,#141d2e,#0c1220);}
    .g3{background:radial-gradient(100% 120% at 50% 80%,rgba(255,176,0,0.22),transparent 60%),linear-gradient(150deg,#11192a,#080d18);}
    .g4{background:radial-gradient(120% 100% at 20% 70%,rgba(212,175,55,0.3),transparent 60%),linear-gradient(150deg,#18212f,#0a0f1a);}
    .g5{background:radial-gradient(120% 100% at 80% 20%,rgba(255,176,0,0.26),transparent 60%),linear-gradient(150deg,#131c2c,#090e19);}

    /* testimonials */
    .reviews{background:linear-gradient(180deg,transparent,rgba(13,20,34,0.5),transparent);}
    .rev-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:24px;}
    .rev-card{background:var(--surface);border:1px solid var(--border);border-radius:var(--r-xl);padding:32px 30px;transition:transform var(--dur) var(--ease),border-color var(--dur) var(--ease);}
    .rev-card:hover{transform:translateY(-6px);border-color:var(--border-2);}
    .rev-stars{display:flex;gap:3px;margin-bottom:18px;}
    .rev-stars svg{width:18px;height:18px;fill:var(--amber);}
    .rev-card blockquote{font-size:16px;line-height:1.7;color:var(--fg);margin-bottom:24px;font-style:normal;}
    .rev-who{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px;}
    .rev-av{width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--grad-gold);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-weight:700;color:#1a1206;font-size:18px;flex:none;}
    .rev-name{font-size:15px;font-weight:600;}
    .rev-meta{font-size:12.5px;color:var(--faint);}

    /* CTA + info */
    .cta-block{
      background:
        radial-gradient(120% 140% at 85% 0%, rgba(255,176,0,0.14), transparent 55%),
        linear-gradient(160deg,#10182a 0%,#0a0f1a 100%);
      border:1px solid var(--border-2);border-radius:var(--r-xl);
      padding:64px 56px;position:relative;overflow:hidden;
    }
    .cta-block::before{content:"";position:absolute;top:-50%;right:-10%;width:480px;height:480px;border-radius:50%;background:radial-gradient(circle,rgba(212,175,55,0.18),transparent 70%);filter:blur(20px);pointer-events:none;}
    .cta-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:56px;align-items:center;position:relative;z-index:1;}
    .cta-grid h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,1.4rem+2vw,3rem);font-weight:700;margin-bottom:18px;}
    .cta-grid p{font-size:17px;color:var(--muted);margin-bottom:30px;line-height:1.65;}
    .cta-btns{display:flex;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
    .info-list{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:4px;}
    .info-row{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:16px;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);}
    .info-row:last-child{border-bottom:none;}
    .info-ic{width:42px;height:42px;border-radius:12px;background:var(--grad-gold-soft);border:1px solid rgba(255,176,0,0.22);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--amber);flex:none;}
    .info-ic svg{width:20px;height:20px;}
    .info-k{font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--faint);font-weight:600;margin-bottom:3px;}
    .info-v{font-size:15.5px;color:var(--fg);font-weight:500;}

    /* footer */
    footer{border-top:1px solid var(--border);padding:48px 0 64px;}
    .foot-inner{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:20px;}
    .foot-brand{font-family:'Playfair Display',serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:700;}
    .foot-copy{font-size:13.5px;color:var(--faint);}
    .foot-soc{display:flex;gap:12px;}
    .foot-soc a{width:40px;height:40px;border-radius:50%;border:1px solid var(--border);display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;color:var(--muted);transition:all var(--dur) var(--ease);}
    .foot-soc a:hover{border-color:var(--amber);color:var(--amber);transform:translateY(-3px);}
    .foot-soc svg{width:18px;height:18px;}

    /* responsive */
    @media(max-width:1024px){
      .svc-grid{grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);}
      .hero-grid{gap:44px;}
    }
    @media(max-width:860px){
      .hero-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .hero-visual{height:420px;order:-1;}
      .val-grid,.rev-grid,.gal-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      .gal-grid{grid-auto-rows:180px;}
      .gal.tall{grid-row:span 1;}
      .cta-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:38px;}
      .cta-block{padding:44px 30px;}
    }
    @media(max-width:520px){
      .wrap{padding:0 18px;}
      .svc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr;}
      section{padding:68px 0;}
      .proof{gap:16px;}
      .proof-div{display:none;}
    }

    @media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){
      *{animation:none !important;transition:none !important;scroll-behavior:auto !important;}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <!-- Demo bar -->
  <div style="position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:9999;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;padding:8px 16px;background:rgba(7,11,20,0.94);backdrop-filter:blur(8px);border-bottom:2px solid #ffb000;font-family:ui-monospace,'JetBrains Mono',monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.08em;">
    <a href="/portfolio" style="color:#ffb000;text-decoration:none;white-space:nowrap;">← PORTFOLIO</a>
    <span style="color:#8ea0b8;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;white-space:nowrap;">SAMPLE 41 · 뤼미에르 스파 — 브랜드 색감 × UI UX Pro Max UX</span>
    <a href="/contact" style="color:#070b14;background:#ffb000;padding:6px 12px;text-decoration:none;font-weight:700;white-space:nowrap;border-radius:2px;">제작 문의 →</a>
  </div>
  <div style="height:40px;"></div>

  <!-- Nav -->
  <nav class="nav">
    <div class="wrap nav-inner">
      <a href="#top" class="brand">Lumière<small>Spa · Cheongdam</small></a>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="#services">시그니처</a>
        <a href="#values">브랜드</a>
        <a href="#gallery">갤러리</a>
        <a href="#reviews">후기</a>
        <a href="#booking">예약·위치</a>
      </div>
      <a href="#booking" class="btn btn-primary nav-cta">예약하기</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <header class="hero" id="top">
    <div class="wrap hero-grid">
      <div>
        <span class="badge"><span class="dot"></span>오늘 예약 가능 · 청담 본점</span>
        <h1>고요한 빛이 머무는<br/><em class="text-gold">다크 럭셔리</em> 살롱</h1>
        <p class="hero-lead">블랙과 골드의 절제된 무드 속에서, 피부와 손끝까지 섬세하게 돌보는 청담동 프리미엄 뷰티 스파. 당신만을 위한 한 시간을 예약하세요.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a href="#booking" class="btn btn-primary">
            <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><rect x="3" y="4" width="18" height="18" rx="2"/><path d="M16 2v4M8 2v4M3 10h18"/></svg>
            지금 예약하기
          </a>
          <a href="#services" class="btn btn-outline">
            시술 둘러보기
            <svg class="icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
          </a>
        </div>
        <div class="proof">
          <div class="proof-stars">
            <div class="stars">
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.9 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z"/></svg>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.9 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z"/></svg>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.9 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z"/></svg>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.9 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z"/></svg>
              <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 2l3 6.3 6.9 1-5 4.9 1.2 6.8L12 17.8 5.9 21l1.2-6.8-5-4.9 6.9-1z"/></svg>
